{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECORDED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECORDED</strong> is an action-packed first-person shooter that puts you right in the action through a hyper-realistic bodycam perspective, powered by the incredible Unreal Engine 5. Experience intense, immersive combat with unique gun physics and gameplay mechanics designed to deliver a fun yet challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/531b94d74adb919dc4ffa43383d65a0b.poster.avif?t=1768414280\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/531b94d74adb919dc4ffa43383d65a0b.webm?t=1768414280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/531b94d74adb919dc4ffa43383d65a0b.mp4?t=1768414280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECORDED</strong> features multiple levels, weapon customization, co-op zombies, team deathmatch, free-for-all, and more. All modes and maps can be played solo offline or online with friends, offering endless replay ability and intense firefights every time you play. Outdoor levels include dynamic weather and time-of-day changes, making each game feel fresh, whether it\u2019s raining, snowing, sunny, or overcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/0337a608392c133579e75076fa37fa7a.poster.avif?t=1768414280\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/0337a608392c133579e75076fa37fa7a.webm?t=1768414280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/0337a608392c133579e75076fa37fa7a.mp4?t=1768414280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECORDED</strong> also features a wide selection of guns with extensive weapon and loadout customization, allowing you to tailor your playstyle to any situation. Look forward to future updates that will introduce new game modes, characters, character customization, weapons, knives, maps, and much more. No hit markers, no kill cams\u2014just straight realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/84c0ba68c267a826dad3469fd49e9621.poster.avif?t=1768414280\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/84c0ba68c267a826dad3469fd49e9621.webm?t=1768414280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091210/extras/84c0ba68c267a826dad3469fd49e9621.mp4?t=1768414280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>KC6067</strong>, a passionate <strong>solo developer</strong> with years of experience and a love for creating unique, high-quality gaming experiences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive thanks to games like <u>BODYCAM</u> and <u>UNRECORD</u> for the idea of a bodycam game, Go check there games out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music\u00a0<strong>Phonk Cyberpunk by Infraction &amp; Lazerpunk</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091210?t=1768414280","b